Justin Trudeau blesses Belt and Road Magazine, a collaboration between Red Maple News, The People’s Daily, and 俄罗斯卫星通讯社- Russian state-owned Sputnik. It’s the brainchild of Liberal volunteer Gu Jianyun.

Gu, a United Front resource, has campaigned with Trudeau since 2015.

